WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.706
The first time you press Control, Option
and 4, Scry Sync asks to see your screen.

2
00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:13.848
macOS needs your OK before any app can
take a picture of the screen.

3
00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:20.570
Choose Open System Settings, open Screen
and System Audio Recording,

4
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.561
and turn on Scry Sync.

5
00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:27.995
macOS may ask you to reopen it, and may
ask again every month.
